{
 "about": {
  "loops": "Every loop:true file is padded with 0.3 s of its own periodic continuation on both sides. Play it with AudioBufferSourceNode loop=true, loopStart/loopEnd from here, and start(t, loopStart). Plain loop=true without loopStart/loopEnd will click. The padding absorbs MP3 decoder delay differences (WebKit decodes 576 samples later than Chrome; both stay seamless).",
  "engine": "set sport = Scion FR-S boxer-4 (on-load only, 2500-7000 rpm every 500); set sedan = Mercedes 190E 2.3-16V (on-load 1292/2555/6210, off-load 1034/2429/6297). Each loop is constant rpm (order-tracked) and an integer number of engine cycles. Crossfade the two nearest-rpm layers (equal power) and set playbackRate = rpm / layer.rpm. All loops are normalized to -16 LUFS; apply your own rpm/throttle gain curve.",
  "levels": "SFX loops -16 LUFS, one-shots about -16 LUFS (crash/impact transients limited at -1 dBFS), UI about -18 LUFS or -3 dBFS peak for very short clicks, music -14 LUFS."
 },
